+# NOTE-5: Limit the length of a note
+
+## Definition of Ready
+Problem: A very long note makes the list hard to read.
+Acceptance criteria:
+- Notes.add() raises ValueError for a text of more than 500 characters.
+Non-goals: No limit on the number of notes.
+Test oracle: A unit test adds a text of 501 characters and expects ValueError.
+Personas: admin
